# Project TITAN Professional V1.0 — Development Standard (PM Final)

**Purpose:** **NDK PQMS (Production & Quality Management System)** — MES 연동 기반 생산·품질 실무. Prioritize **design and consistency** over speed.

**Architecture (FINAL):** `.cursor/rules/project-titan-mes-architecture-final.mdc` · `src/config/mesArchitecturePolicy.js`

**Source of truth (code):** `src/config/developmentStandard.js`, `src/config/menuStructure.js`

---

## 1. Project Structure Rules

- Keep the **originally approved folder structure** — do not reorganize without PM approval.
- **Reuse shared components** — do not duplicate the same UI pattern per page.
- **Separate page CSS from shared CSS** — page-specific styles only in that page folder; shared styles in `src/foundation/styles/` and Foundation components.
- **Extend, do not replace** — new features grow within existing structure.

## 2. Development Order (Mandatory)

Every screen follows this sequence. **No coding before design is complete.**

```text
기획 → 화면 설계 → PM 승인 → Cursor 개발 → 테스트 → Git Commit → Git Push
```

**Completion criteria:** Sidebar → Router → Layout → Tab → click test → Console/Terminal Error = 0. **Build success alone is not completion.**

### 공식 개발 프로세스 (V1.3 최종)

**Code:** `OFFICIAL_DEVELOPMENT_PROCESS` · `SINGLE_SCREEN_WORKFLOW` · `REGRESSION_TEST_CHECKLIST` · `SHARED_COMPONENT_CHANGE_POLICY` in `developmentStandard.js`

```text
분석 → 원인·영향 보고 → PM 승인 → 최소 범위 수정
→ npm run build → 실행 테스트 → Regression Test → Git Commit
→ Git Push (presentation) → beta-demo 동기화 · Push → Beta 배포 확인 → 다음 작업
```

**하루 작업 = 기능 하나 = Commit 하나.** 5~6 화면 동시 수정 금지.

```text
① 검사관리 개선 → Build → 실행 테스트 → Commit
② 문서관리 개선 → Build → 실행 테스트 → Commit
③ QR관리 추가     → Build → 실행 테스트 → Commit
```

**Code:** `DAILY_WORK_COMMIT_POLICY` · `DEVELOPMENT_ABSOLUTE_PROHIBITIONS` in `developmentStandard.js`

**Regression Test (매 작업 후):** HOME · 로그인 · Sidebar · Router · 모든 메뉴 진입 · White Screen 없음 · Console Error = 0

**공통 컴포넌트 수정 시:** TitanDataTable · TitanSearchPanel · TitanScreenDetailPopup · TitanTableRowActions 등 — **사용하는 모든 페이지 테스트 + 영향 목록·결과 보고** 후에만 완료 처리.

### White Screen · 긴급 복구 — Git 기반 (임시 패치 ❌)

**Code:** `GIT_BASED_INCIDENT_RECOVERY` · `LAST_KNOWN_GOOD_COMMIT` · `docs/WHITE_SCREEN_GIT_RECOVERY_REPORT.md`

```text
마지막 정상 Commit (Baseline) 확인
→ git diff Baseline..HEAD · AppRouter import 체인
→ White Screen 원인 파일 특정
→ 문제 파일만 checkout/수정 (전체 재작성 ❌)
→ Build · 실행 테스트 · Regression
→ 정상 확인 후 기능별 순차 재적용 (Commit 단위)
```

- **임시방편·추측 수정 금지** — Git diff 근거 필수
- Build 성공만으로 완료 ❌ (`AppRouter` eager import → 런타임 crash 가능)
- White Screen 상태 Push · Beta 배포 **절대 금지**

### 설계 승인 = UI 반영

Config·Rule만 변경하고 실제 Sidebar · Route · Page(UI)에 반영하지 않으면 **미완료**입니다.

**Code:** `DESIGN_APPROVAL_UI_SYNC_PRINCIPLE` · `COMPLETION_CHECKLIST` in `developmentStandard.js`

체크: Rule → Config → Workflow → Sidebar → Route → Page(UI) → browser verify → `npm run build`

See also: `.cursor/rules/project-titan-progress-v1.mdc` for menu status and next priorities.

## 3. Screen Build Order (One at a Time — Commit 단위)

Build **one screen at a time**. Do not start the next screen until the current one is **PM-approved** and **committed**.

- **Do not** modify multiple management pages in one change set.
- **Do not** mark complete without browser test on the changed screen + Regression Test.
- **Do not** batch large refactors (e.g. product list standardization across all pages) without PM-approved phased plan.

**Current priority:** ① 품질관리 (검사일지 · 성적서) → ② 불량이력 → ③ 부서별 업무 (V1.0) → …

```text
HOME → 입출고관리 → 생산관리 → 품질관리 → 부서별 업무 → 통계자료 → 기준정보관리 → 환경설정
```

## 4. UI Development Rules

### Layout (shared shell only)

Use Foundation layout: **Header · Sidebar · Main · Footer** (`src/foundation/layout/AppShell.jsx`).

### Search area

- Show **essential filters only** by default.
- Advanced filters live under **"추가 옵션"** (collapsed by default).

### List (center of every screen)

- **List-first** — list occupies the widest area (`--titan-list-ratio`, `--titan-side-max`).
- Table is the primary content on work screens.

### Detail panel

- Use **collapse (접기/펼치기)**.
- Default: **expanded**.
- When collapsed, list area **automatically widens**.

### Right panel

- Use **only when needed** — not fixed on every screen.

## 5. Component Rules

Use Foundation shared components. **Do not create a new component for the same function.**

| Standard name | Foundation path |
|---------------|-----------------|
| Button | `src/foundation/components/Button.jsx` |
| Table | `src/foundation/components/Table.jsx` |
| Status Badge | `src/foundation/components/StatusChip.jsx` |
| Search Box | `src/foundation/components/SearchPanel.jsx` |
| Card | `src/foundation/components/Card.jsx` |
| Collapse Panel | `src/foundation/components/CollapsePanel.jsx` |
| Modal / Popup | Add under `src/foundation/components/` when first approved screen needs them — reuse thereafter |

Expand stubs only when PM-approved design requires it.

## 6. CSS Rules

- **Shared styles first** — `src/foundation/styles/foundation.css` + component CSS.
- **Never hardcode colors** in components or pages — use Design Tokens in `src/foundation/styles/tokens.css`.
- Token groups: Primary, Secondary, Success, Warning, Danger, Border, Background, Text, Shadow, Status.

## 7. Table Rules (Core of TITAN)

All screens use **one shared table style** (Foundation Table when implemented).

- Fixed header · hover · sortable columns · pagination · checkbox selection · status badge
- **Do not change column order/format arbitrarily** — follow common column rules (Date, ID, Company, Item, LOT, etc.) per screen design.

## 8. Input Rules

- **Minimize manual input.**
- Auto-fill when possible: 관리번호, 등록일, 작성자, 상태, etc.

## 9. Workflow Rules (Fixed — Do Not Change)

All menus align to this flow:

```text
입고 → 생산 → 품질 → 출고 → 통계
```

Detailed chain: 입고 등록 → 작업지시서 → 생산정보 등록 → 검사일지 → 성적서 → 출고 → 이력조회

See `WORKFLOW_STEPS` in `src/config/menuStructure.js`.

## 10. Data Rules

- **Never enter the same data twice** — Master/입출고/관리번호는 **MES Source of Truth** (TITAN **조회만**).
- **mesManagementNo** (예: DL260702-016) = 품질 데이터 Primary Key · **TITAN 생성 ❌**
- Demo: SessionStorage = 가상 MES · `getRepositories()` 경유
- Data entered once is **reused** across menus via **mesManagementNo**

## 11. Change Rules

- Fixing one feature must **not break other screens**.
- Changing a **shared component** requires verifying **all screens** that use it.

## 12. Test Checklist (Every New Feature)

- Sidebar navigation · Router · Layout · Tab
- UI layout intact · responsive behavior · data binding · button actions · search · CRUD · workflow links
- **Console Error = 0 · Terminal Error = 0**
- Actual click test in browser — not build-only verification

## 12.1 Menu Addition Checklist

**Menu Freeze V1.0 (2026-07-03) — 메뉴 구조 변경 금지.** See `src/config/menuFreezeV1.js` and `.cursor/rules/project-titan-menu-freeze-v1.mdc`.

이후 개발 순서: **Workflow → 기능 → UI → 구현 → 테스트**

## 13. Cursor Rules (Strict)

- **No UI structure changes without PM approval.**
- **Do not alter approved designs.**
- **Do not add new colors or layouts** outside Design Tokens and approved patterns.
- **Prefer existing Foundation components.**
- **Structure and consistency over feature count.**
- **Fix root cause via Git** — identify file in diff, revert or fix that file only; no temporary hacks.

## 14. Development Philosophy

Not a "many features fast" project. Goal: **easiest, fastest real NDK operations.**

- Real work first · list-first · minimal input · maximum inquiry · shared components · simple intuitive UI · easy maintenance · extensible structure

## Terminology

- Do not use `오늘` in user-facing text.
- Date basis: `금일`, `전일`, `금월`, `전월`.

## Legacy

- Do not import or extend prototype UI: `src/components/layout/`, `src/components/ui/`, `src/styles/titan-*.css`, `ndk-v2-ui.css`.
